# Known-modules catalog — <name>|<url>|<private:true|false>
#
# Empty of real entries until Wave C, per ARCHITECTURE.md §10/§11 — the
# ecosystem modules (workbench-git, workbench-gpg, workbench-ssh,
# workbench-shell) don't exist as repos yet. `wb add <name>` still works
# for any name today by passing a url explicitly; this file only saves
# typing the url once modules exist to list here.
#
# Example (uncomment and edit once a real repo exists):
# git|https://github.com/<you>/workbench-git.git|false
# gpg|https://github.com/<you>/workbench-gpg.git|false
# ssh|https://github.com/<you>/workbench-ssh.git|false
# shell|https://github.com/<you>/workbench-shell.git|false
